{"version":1,"content":"<p>藝人張寶兒與譚俊彥今日（26日）現身無綫將軍澳電視城，出席《長期服務暨傑出員工榮譽大獎頒獎典禮2026》，兩人同獲10年服務獎。</p><p>&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;寶兒表示這10年來很難忘，經歷很多：「我由畢業出嚟工作，再結婚生仔。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-26T10:03:53.563293+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":109,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-26T08:36:58+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-26T09:57:14.356451+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-26T09:57:14.356451+00:00","content_hash":"9275f3e35db55db4d9b08020828f7c1556dcffeec30b32834fd29f009a30ff9a","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}